<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Activate scraper-->
  <VFED.ActivateScraper>激活刮刀</VFED.ActivateScraper>
  <!--EN: Enable intel scraper countdown, which will release a pulse every 60 seconds, giving you a chance of obtaining valuable intel at a chance of triggering imperial investigation.-->
  <VFED.ActivateScraper.Desc>启用情报抓取倒计时，每 60 秒释放一次脉冲，让您有机会获得有价值的情报，从而触发帝国调查。</VFED.ActivateScraper.Desc>
  <!--EN: Aerodrone bombardment-->
  <VFED.AerodroneBombardment>飞机轰炸</VFED.AerodroneBombardment>
  <!--EN: The {0} has dispatched a number of aerodrones to your location. They suspect you are harboring deserters with ill intention towards the Great Hierarchy.
An aerodrone is an unmanned atmospheric drone designed for military purposes. Controlled by highly skilled warprogrammers from imperial installations, the aerodrone is a highly effective tool for eliminating enemies of the Empire. Equipped with advanced sensors and targeting systems, the aerodrone can detect and track targets from great distances. Once a target has been identified, the aerodrone will unleash a devastating salvo of precision rockets, each one designed to cause maximum damage and destruction.
The Empire has pinpointed the location of your critical infrastructure and the aerodrones will shortly initiate their bombardment. Evacuation is advised.-->
  <VFED.AerodroneBombardment.Desc>{0} 已向您所在位置派遣了多架无人机。他们怀疑你窝藏对伟大等级制度怀有恶意的逃兵。
    无人机是一种专为军事目的而设计的无人大气无人机。无人机由帝国设施中技术精湛的战争程序员控制，是消灭帝国敌人的高效工具。无人机配备了先进的传感器和瞄准系统，可以远距离探测和跟踪目标。一旦确定目标，无人机将发射毁灭性的精确火箭齐射，每一枚都旨在造成最大的伤害和破坏。
    帝国已经确定了你们关键基础设施的位置，无人机很快就会开始轰炸。建议疏散。</VFED.AerodroneBombardment.Desc>
  <!--EN: Already invisible-->
  <VFED.AlreadyInvisibile>已隐形</VFED.AlreadyInvisibile>
  <!--EN: Biosecured crates can only be opened by characters with a noble backstory.-->
  <VFED.BiosecuredCrateWarning>生物安全箱子只能由具有高贵背景的角色打开。</VFED.BiosecuredCrateWarning>
  <!--EN: Burnout intel scraper intercepted high value imperial communication and generated {0} critical intel.-->
  <VFED.BurnoutCriticalIntelGained>Burnout intel scraper 拦截了高价值的帝国通信并生成了 {0} 个关键情报。</VFED.BurnoutCriticalIntelGained>
  <!--EN: Burnout intel scraper intercepted imperial communication and generated {0} intel.-->
  <VFED.BurnoutIntelGained>Burnout Intel scraper 拦截了帝国通信并生成了 {0} 英特尔。</VFED.BurnoutIntelGained>
  <!--EN: Burnout intel scraper was intercepted by an imperial patrol nearby. They are moving in to engage.-->
  <VFED.BurnoutRaid>Burnout情报刮刀被附近的帝国巡逻队拦截。他们正在参与进来。</VFED.BurnoutRaid>
  <!--EN: Burnout intel scraper attracted imperial attention and has increased your visibility by {0}. (Current visibility is {1}.)-->
  <VFED.BurnoutVisibilityIncreased>Burnout intel scraper 引起了帝国的注意，并将您的可见度提高了 {0}。 （当前可见性为 {1}。）</VFED.BurnoutVisibilityIncreased>
  <!--EN: Building a burnout intel scraper will be considered a declaration of war with the Empire.-->
  <VFED.BurnoutWarning>建造一个倦怠英特尔刮刀将被视为向帝国宣战。</VFED.BurnoutWarning>
  <!--EN: requires noble backstory-->
  <VFED.CantOpenBiosecured>需要高贵的背景故事</VFED.CantOpenBiosecured>
  <!--EN: Your contraband has arrived.-->
  <VFED.ContrabandArrived>您的违禁品已到达。</VFED.ContrabandArrived>
  <!--EN: Deactivate scraper-->
  <VFED.DeactivateScraper>停用刮刀</VFED.DeactivateScraper>
  <!--EN: Disable intel scraper, stopping the countdown until the next pulse.-->
  <VFED.DeactivateScraper.Desc>禁用英特尔刮刀，停止倒计时直到下一个脉冲。</VFED.DeactivateScraper.Desc>
  <!--EN: Deploy-->
  <VFED.Deploy>部署</VFED.Deploy>
  <!--EN: Deploy this {0} to create a {1} at this location.-->
  <VFED.Deploy.Desc>部署此 {0} 以在此位置创建 {1}。</VFED.Deploy.Desc>
  <!--EN: You have been detected by security. The garrison is deploying against you.-->
  <VFED.DetectedWarning>您已被安全检测到。驻军正在针对你部署。</VFED.DetectedWarning>
  <!--EN: Detonate-->
  <VFED.Detonate>引爆</VFED.Detonate>
  <!--EN: Detonate bomb pack-->
  <VFED.Detonate.BombPack>引爆炸弹包</VFED.Detonate.BombPack>
  <!--EN: Detonate this bomb pack remotely to generate a big explosion. WARNING: Pressing this button will immediately set off the bomb.-->
  <VFED.Detonate.BombPack.Desc>远程引爆此炸弹包以产生大爆炸。警告：按下此按钮将立即引爆炸弹。</VFED.Detonate.BombPack.Desc>
  <!--EN: The Orbital Slicer Beam satellites have finished arranging into a beautiful flower pattern above your colony. What comes next can only be described as total destruction. The slicer beams fire down from the sky, creating a web of energy that systematically levels everything in its path. The terrain itself seems to buckle and heave as the beams slice through the earth, leaving behind deep crevices and rubble-filled craters. People, vehicles, and even buildings are reduced to nothing more than dust and ash in a matter of seconds. The air itself is superheated by the intense energy of the beams, creating a blast wave that can travel for miles.
There is no escape from the Divine Inferno. Those caught in its path are instantly vaporized, leaving behind nothing but charred remnants of what was once there. Even underground shelters are no match for the destructive power of the slicer beams, as they cut through the earth like a hot knife through butter.
The aftermath of Divine Inferno is a wasteland of destruction. The landscape is unrecognizable, with little more than rubble and ash as far as the eye can see. The air is still thick with the acrid smell of burnt flesh and melting metal. The once-thriving colony is now nothing more than a scorched and lifeless husk.-->
  <VFED.DivineInferno.Desc>轨道切片光束卫星已在您的殖民地上空排列成美丽的花朵图案。接下来的事情只能用彻底毁灭来形容。切片机从空中发射光束，形成能量网，系统地平整其路径上的一切。当光束切穿大地时，地形本身似乎会弯曲和隆起，留下深深的裂缝和布满碎石的陨石坑。人、车辆、甚至建筑物都在几秒钟内化为尘埃和灰烬。空气本身被光束的强烈能量加热，产生可以传播数英里的冲击波。
    神火之中，无处可逃。那些被它挡住的东西会立即蒸发，只留下曾经存在的烧焦的残余物。即使是地下避难所也无法与切片光束的破坏力相抗衡，因为它们就像热刀切黄油一样切穿大地。
    神火之后的余波，是一片毁灭荒原。眼前的景色已经面目全非，放眼望去，只剩下瓦砾和灰烬。空气中仍然弥漫着烧焦的肉和熔化的金属的刺鼻气味。曾经繁荣的殖民地现在只不过是一个烧焦且毫无生气的外壳。</VFED.DivineInferno.Desc>
  <!--EN: Divine Inferno initiated-->
  <VFED.DivineInferno.Init>神圣地狱启动</VFED.DivineInferno.Init>
  <!--EN: Enable Invisibility-->
  <VFED.EnableInvisibility>启用隐形</VFED.EnableInvisibility>
  <!--EN: Turn this colonist invisible for 1 hour. If the colonist attacks anyone, the invisibility will end.-->
  <VFED.EnableInvisibility.Desc>使该殖民者隐形 1 小时。如果殖民者攻击任何人，隐形就会结束。</VFED.EnableInvisibility.Desc>
  <!--EN: Exhausted-->
  <VFED.Exhausted>已耗尽</VFED.Exhausted>
  <!--EN: Extract intel-->
  <VFED.ExtractIntel>提取英特尔</VFED.ExtractIntel>
  <!--EN: Extract intel from the brain of a nobleperson. They may be alive, or downed, but the brain must be present. Will destroy the brain.-->
  <VFED.ExtractIntel.Desc>从贵族的大脑中提取情报。他们可能还活着，也可能已经倒下，但大脑必须存在。会破坏大脑。</VFED.ExtractIntel.Desc>
  <!--EN: {0} is attempting to escape!-->
  <VFED.FleeWarning>{0}正在尝试逃跑！</VFED.FleeWarning>
  <!--EN: Glassing date-->
  <VFED.GlassingDate>玻璃日期</VFED.GlassingDate>
  <!--EN: Due to imperial disinformation, your relations with {0} have dropped by 10.-->
  <VFED.GoodwillDropVisibility>由于帝国的虚假信息，您与 {0} 的关系下降了 10。</VFED.GoodwillDropVisibility>
  <!--EN: The defenders are moving to high alert.-->
  <VFED.HighAlertWarning>防御者正在进入高度戒备状态。</VFED.HighAlertWarning>
  <!--EN: {0} patrol-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol>{0}巡逻</VFED.ImperialPatrol>
  <!--EN: Attack the patrol.-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol.Attack>攻击巡逻队。</VFED.ImperialPatrol.Attack>
  <!--EN: {0} has encountered an imperial patrol from {1}. They have been spotted! {0} can try and escape, but this will inevitably increase the visibility of {2}. Fighting the patrol might be tough, but it will keep {2} safe. The patrol consists of:\n\n{3}-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol.Desc>{0} 遇到了来自 {1} 的帝国巡逻队。他们被发现了！ {0} 可以尝试逃脱，但这将不可避免地增加 {2}
    的可见性。与巡逻队战斗可能很困难，但它可以保证{2}的安全。巡逻队包括：\n\n{3}</VFED.ImperialPatrol.Desc>
  <!--EN: Escape the patrol.-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol.Escape>逃离巡逻队。</VFED.ImperialPatrol.Escape>
  <!--EN: {0} has given up {1} to the Empire. It’s unlikely you will ever see them again. Empire doesn’t take kindly to saboteurs.-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol.GaveUp>{0} 已将 {1} 交给帝国。你不太可能再见到他们。帝国不会善待破坏者。</VFED.ImperialPatrol.GaveUp>
  <!--EN: Give up {0}.-->
  <VFED.ImperialPatrol.GiveUp>放弃 {0}。</VFED.ImperialPatrol.GiveUp>
  <!--EN: {0} has been stripped from their title of {1}. They have provided you with {2} Intel.-->
  <VFED.IntelFromTitle>{0} 已从其标题 {1} 中删除。他们为您提供了 {2}Intel。</VFED.IntelFromTitle>
  <!--EN: Intel will go out of date in: {0}-->
  <VFED.IntelOutOfDate>英特尔 将在以下时间过期：{0}</VFED.IntelOutOfDate>
  <!--EN: {0} has gone out of date. Consider using up the intel you gather before it goes out of date.-->
  <VFED.IntelOutOfDateNow>{0} 已过期。考虑在你收集的情报过时之前用完它。</VFED.IntelOutOfDateNow>
  <!--EN: Must have psylink-->
  <VFED.MustHavePsylink>必须有 迷联</VFED.MustHavePsylink>
  <!--EN: {0} from {1} are attempting to avenge {2}.-->
  <VFED.NobleKilledRevenge>来自 {1} 的 {0} 正在尝试为 {2} 报仇。</VFED.NobleKilledRevenge>
  <!--EN: On cooldown-->
  <VFED.OnCooldown>冷却中</VFED.OnCooldown>
  <!--EN: Pulses before burn out: {0}-->
  <VFED.PulsesBeforeOut>烧坏前的脉冲：{0}</VFED.PulsesBeforeOut>
  <!--EN: Imperial response-->
  <VFED.ResponseComing>帝国响应</VFED.ResponseComing>
  <!--EN: An imperial {0} is on its way to this location. It will arrive in {1}s.-->
  <VFED.ResponseComingDesc>一架帝国 {0} 正在前往此位置的途中。它将在 {1} 秒内到达。</VFED.ResponseComingDesc>
  <!--EN: Due to triggering an imperial response, your visibility has increased by {0}. It is now {1}. In the future, you can avoid increasing the visibility by completing the mission before the response arrives.-->
  <VFED.ResponseMessage>由于触发了帝国响应，您的可见度增加了 {0}。现在是{1}。将来，您可以通过在响应到达之前完成任务来避免增加可见性。</VFED.ResponseMessage>
  <!--EN: Goodwill with {0} increased by 5 due to positive rumors from imperial deserters.-->
  <VFED.ServiceIncreasedGoodwill>由于帝国逃兵的正面传言，与 {0} 的好感度增加了 5。</VFED.ServiceIncreasedGoodwill>
  <!--EN: {0} beams fired, {1} beams left-->
  <VFED.ShotsFiredLeft>发射了 {0} 束光束，向左发射了 {1} 束光束</VFED.ShotsFiredLeft>
  <!--EN: You have activated an imperial surveillance pillar. Visibility of your faction has increased by {1}. It is now {0}.-->
  <VFED.SurveillancePillarActivated>您已激活帝国监视支柱。您的派系的可见度已提高了 {1}。现在是{0}。</VFED.SurveillancePillarActivated>
  <!--EN: Click to switch to {0}-->
  <VFED.SwitchTo>点击切换到{0}</VFED.SwitchTo>
  <!--EN: Time until next pulse: {0}-->
  <VFED.TimeToNextPulse>距下一个脉冲的时间：{0}</VFED.TimeToNextPulse>
  <!--EN: Visibility Changed: {0}-->
  <VFED.VisibilityChange>可见性已更改：{0}</VFED.VisibilityChange>
  <!--EN: Your visibility level has changed. It is now {0}.-->
  <VFED.VisibilityChange.Desc>您的可见性级别已更改。现在是 {0}。</VFED.VisibilityChange.Desc>
  <!--EN: Visibility decreases by {0}-->
  <VFED.VisibilityDecreases>能见度降低 {0}</VFED.VisibilityDecreases>
  <!--EN: Visibility will decrease by {0}. This may reduce imperial responses.-->
  <VFED.VisibilityDecreases.Desc>可见度将降低 {0}。这可能会减少帝国的反应。</VFED.VisibilityDecreases.Desc>
  <!--EN: The following effects have activated:-->
  <VFED.VisibilityEffectsActive>以下效果已激活：</VFED.VisibilityEffectsActive>
  <!--EN: The following effects have deactivated:-->
  <VFED.VisibilityEffectsInactive>以下效果已停用：</VFED.VisibilityEffectsInactive>
  <!--EN: Visibility increases by {0}-->
  <VFED.VisibilityIncreases>可见度增加 {0}</VFED.VisibilityIncreases>
  <!--EN: Visibility will increase by {0}. This may lead to more and stronger imperial responses.-->
  <VFED.VisibilityIncreases.Desc>可见度将增加 {0}。这可能会导致更多、更强烈的帝国反应。</VFED.VisibilityIncreases.Desc>
